wide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1944258, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15o76.jpg"}, {"id": 1944256, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15o74.jpg"}, {"id": 1944259, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15o77.jpg"}, {"id": 1944260, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15o78.jpg"}, {"id": 1944257, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15o75.jpg"}], "slug": "sturmjager", "summary": "Sturmj\u00e4ger is a sci-fi shoot 'em up for everyone who wants to skip the cinematic fluff and dive straight into unadulterated, chaotic, and adrenaline-fueled arcade action. Master ten unique missions, either solo or with a friend in local co-op.\n\nEvery single stage features its own distinct visual theme and a custom-tailored soundtrack, taking you from the deepest corners of outer space straight to the bottom of the ocean, merciless boss fights included.\n\nWith three different game modes and three difficulty levels, maximum replayability is guaranteed, no matter how fast your reflexes are.\n\nThe rules are simple: If it moves, shoot it. If it doesn't move... shoot it anyway, just to be safe.\n\nGenre veterans are in for a treat: The deep, finely-tuned scoring system rewards aggressive and flawless gameplay. Rack up massive score multipliers with quick kills, kill chains, risky proximity close-quarters attacks, no-death runs, and much more. Perfect your strategy, climb the global online leaderboards, and test your mettle against the best pilots in the world!", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sturmjager", "videos": [{"id": 199250, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "PfPbWzveZjU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PfPbWzveZjU", "title": "Sturmj\u00e4ger Official Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PfPbWzveZjU/uhddefault.jpg"}]}